ntry>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant> <applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TOMOMORI TATSUO</name> <address><country>JP</country> </address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TOYO KOHAN CO LTD</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YAMANE KEIJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OHMURA, HIDEO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OHMURA, HITOSHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TOMOMORI, TATSUO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TOYO KOHAN CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAMANE, KEIJI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OHMURA HIDEO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OHMURA HITOSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TOMOMORI TATSUO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YAMANE KEIJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OHMURA, HIDEO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OHMURA, HITOSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TOMOMORI, TATSUO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAMANE, KEIJI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A surface-treated steel sheet for a battery improved in its electric contact with a battery positive electrode active substance, a method of production thereof, a battery case and a battery. The surface-treated steel sheet is formed on at least the surface thereof serving as an inner side of a battery case with a graphite-dispersed nickel-plated layer or a graphite-dispersed nickel-alloy-plated layer, which alloy-plated layer is preferably formed by a nickel-cobalt alloy, nickel-cobalt-iron alloy, nickel-manganese alloy, nickel-phosphorus alloy or nickel-bismuth alloy. The battery case is formed by drawing, DI working and DTR working the above surface-treated steel sheet, and the battery uses the battery case.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>La présente invention concerne une feuille d'acier traitée en surface pour accumulateur, qui établit un contact électrique amélioré avec la substance active de l'électrode positive de l'accumulateur, ainsi qu'un procédé de production de cette feuille d'acier traitée en surface, un bac d'accumulateur et un accumulateur. La feuille d'acier traitée en surface est formée, au moins sur la surface qui est utilisée comme côté intérieur du bac d'accumulateur, d'une couche nickelée à graphite dispersé ou d'une couche plaquée dans un alliage de nickel à graphite dispersé, de préférence un alliage nickel-cobalt, nickel-cobalt-fer, nickel-manganèse, nickel-phosphore ou nickel-bismuth. On fabrique le bac d'accumulateur en travaillant la feuille d'acier traitée en surface par étirage, par emboutissage-étirage ou par réemboutissage. L'invention se rapporte enfin à l'accumulateur dans lequel est utilisé le bac d'accumulateur fabriqué selon le procédé précité.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>